# Manifold level 10
# The fortress's outer wall (stage 5m, from 5f's): the first level. Outside, the wall: a breach its lantern
# lights, and far east a dark culvert, the long way in. The yard: a guard walking its width, a lantern in
# its middle, crates, a storage with a scroll in it. The inner wall's gate, lit from both sides, a guard
# at its post facing the yard (a pebble thrown to the yard takes it to look). Past it, the way out. A
# second scroll in the yard's west corner, behind crates. Drawn as a plan (plans/level-1.plan).
title The outer wall
spawn 0 1 8
facing 0 0 -1
ambient 0.12
sky 22.0

plan -20 -26
